<title>GREECE: Bank of Greece drains 250 bln drs at 11.90 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank of Greece drains 250 bln drs at 11.90 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Greece drained 250 billion drachmas of 14-day funds at 11.90 percent in today's fixed interest rate tender, it said.</p>
<p>&quot;The tender .. was oversubscribed. Individual bids were thus satisfied pro rata on the basis of the ensuing allotment ratio of 8.43 percent,&quot; it said. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
